Subject: [PATCH] feat(kanban): advertise workspace source protocol 2 [daveey]

Activate the landed v2 consumer only within enabled dispatcher grant calls. Preserve default-off configuration, CLI omission, old-Board suppression and v1 attachment defaults. Add actual acquire payload and nested/exception context coverage.

Proof: RED 3 protocol assertions on baseline; GREEN 38 source suites / 554 tests, scripts/check passed. Live two-worker acceptance remains with t_0a6a9f59d9af4492; no live config or custody changed.
